  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "View PDF",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You should now be at a stage where you have identified the successful tenderer(s).",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "From a fraud awareness perspective, the following checks should be made before progressing to the next stage.",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Tender Award Documentation",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Before you award a contract you should check the following points:",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Who was involved in the tender award process?",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Have there been any changes in staff from those involved during the tender evaluation?",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Did any of the tenderers drop out of the process and decide not to proceed with the tender? Consider if an unknown agreement has been made.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Review the list of suppliers/sub-contractors. Are they the same as other bidders involved in the tender exercise? Such circumstances can lead to a pre-determined outcome and therefore it would be irrelevant who is awarded the work. This may identify cartel operating.",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Tender Award",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "A Contract Award recommendation report should be prepared by you prior to approval by the appropriate authority level within your Organisation. This recommendation report should be endosed by the User Intelligence Group.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Checklist",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Award Recommendations Report Checklist",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Award Recommendations Report Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Once you have obtained approval you can notify both the successful and unsuccessful tenderers of the outcome.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Award Recommendations Report Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quickfire Guide",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Award Recommendations Report Checklist"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "As soon as possible you:",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "must advise any unsuccessful tenderer of the contract award outcome.",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "must inform any unsuccessful tenderer of the criteria used to award the contract and their scoring against those criteria. This should include any decision that the goods or services do not meet the performance or functional requirements",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "must confirm the name of the successful tenderer, and the score of the successful tenderer.",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If requested, you also have to provide the characteristics and relative advantages of the successful tender, within 30 days of request.",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Information should also be provided to tenderers about the grounds for any decision:",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Not to conclude a Framework Agreement that has been advertised",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Not to award a contract that has been advertised",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "To restart the procurement procedure",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Your Organisation may withhold Contract Award information where the release of such information:",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "would prevent the enforcement of the law,",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "be contrary to the public interest,",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "would affect the commercial interests of particular tenderer(s), whether they are public or private, or",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00029",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "may impact fair competition between tenderers.",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00030",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Any tenderer may request additional information regarding the tendering process. You should respond in a timely fashion to any such requests.",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00031",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If PCS-Tender is being utilised, the notification can be issued electronically through this system.",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00032",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Where you have not built an electronic catalogue as part of the tender process and the commodity/service can be catalogued, you should set up the successful tenderer on the Pecos Content Management System (PCM) to ensure that you can prepare the catalogues.",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Communication to Unsuccessful Tenderer(s)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00033",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "PCM is not appropriate for Care and Support Services .",
      "ordinal": 33,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "PCM is not appropriate for Care and Support Services ."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00034",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "For complex Route 2 procurements, you may find some of the guidance and tools in Route 3 to be of benefit.",
      "ordinal": 34,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "PCM is not appropriate for Care and Support Services ."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00035",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Consideration must also be given to Planning , Sustainable Procurement and Risk Management throughout this stage of the Journey.",
      "ordinal": 35,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "PCM is not appropriate for Care and Support Services ."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00036",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Any documents you need are listed below",
      "ordinal": 36,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Award Documentation",
        "Tender Award",
        "Any documents you need are listed below"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
